{"title":"Career Roadmap · Sports Coach","role":"Sports Coach","summary":"A Sports Coach trains athletes or students to improve their physical fitness, sport-specific skills, tactical understanding, performance and competitive readiness.","facts":{"Current degree":"Other Teacher Education (D.El.Ed / B.El.Ed / B.P.Ed / ITEP / Integrated B.Sc-B.Ed / BA-B.Ed)","Course":"Physical Education (B.P.Ed)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Sports Coach trains athletes or students to improve their physical fitness, sport-specific skills, tactical understanding, performance and competitive readiness."},{"type":"p","text":"Sports Coaches can work in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Schools and colleges"},{"text":"Sports academies"},{"text":"Professional sports clubs"},{"text":"University teams"},{"text":"Private training centres"},{"text":"Fitness and performance centres"},{"text":"State and national sports programs"},{"text":"Sports federations"},{"text":"Community sports organizations"},{"text":"Corporate sports programs"},{"text":"Residential sports schools"},{"text":"Athlete development programs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The career can range from school-level coaching to elite performance coaching, depending on sport-specific qualifications, experience and competitive credentials."},{"type":"p","text":"A B.P.Ed provides a strong foundation in physical education, sports science and teaching, but sport-specific coaching certifications and practical competitive experience are highly valuable for professional coaching roles."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","Relevant Undergraduate Degree / B.P.Ed","Sport-Specific Training & Coaching Certification","Coaching Internship / Practical Experience","Assistant Sports Coach","Sports Coach","Senior / Lead Coach","Head Coach","High-Performance Coach","Technical Director / Performance Directo